# =============================================================================
# .gitignore for Snow-pole-based-vehicle-localization
#
# Goal: push only the SOURCE (code, configs, docs, the YOLO model, ground-truth &
# reference CSVs) to GitHub — NOT the ~78 GB of downloaded sensor bags or the
# regenerable pipeline outputs (odometry bags, logs, videos, figures, result CSVs).
#
# Everything excluded here is either (a) downloaded data, or (b) reproducible by
# re-running the scripts, so it does not belong in version control. If you ever
# DO want to archive a specific small artifact, force-add it:  git add -f <path>
# =============================================================================

# ---- Raw / downloaded sensor data (tens of GB — never commit) ---------------
snow_pole_geo_localization_data/

# ---- Large binary recordings & point clouds (anywhere in the tree) ----------
*.bag
*.bag.active
*.db3
*.db3-wal
*.db3-shm
*.mcap
*.pcd
*.ply

# ---- Generated pipeline outputs (regenerable; dominated by multi-GB bags) ----
# The scripts create these dirs with `mkdir -p`, so losing them is harmless.
fasterlio_integration/output/
glim_integration/output/
superlio_integration/output/
output/

# ---- Generated per-backend result CSVs (produced by the pipeline) -----------
# (The ORIGINAL FastReg CSV `incremental_navigation_results.csv` and the
#  ground-truth pole CSV are kept — they are inputs/references, not generated.)
incremental_navigation_results_fasterlio.csv
incremental_navigation_results_glim.csv
incremental_navigation_results_superlio.csv
snowpole_results_*.csv
timing_comparison.csv
run_metrics.csv

# ---- Logs, videos, animations ------------------------------------------------
*.log
*.mp4
*.gif
*.avi
*.mkv

# ---- Python caches & build artifacts ----------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
build/
dist/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# ---- Virtual environments ----------------------------------------------------
.venv/
venv/
env/
.baginspect_venv/
*venv*/

# ---- Editor / OS cruft -------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ---- Secrets / local config (just in case) ----------------------------------
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem

# =============================================================================
# Kept on purpose (do NOT ignore): *.py *.sh *.yaml *.yml *.md *.json(configs)
#   model/pole_best_signal.pt, Trip068.json, LICENSE, README.md,
#   Groundtruth_pole_location_*.csv, incremental_navigation_results.csv,
#   environment.yml, SYSTEM_CONFIGURATION.txt, "Vehicle_GeoLoc paper.pdf"
# Note: timing_*.json live under */output/ and are therefore ignored with it.
# =============================================================================
